  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> be the point on the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math>, which is nearest to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "IXSlr",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cQkeW",
