  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equation of hyperbola,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>And nearest line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now slope of the given line will be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now slope of tangent which will be parallel to given line of&nbsp;hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So, point will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
